  "route": "Real restricted-residue input at a genuine occupied complete-scale fibre; source-only Fine support 599/1000 gives original local 1199/2000 and both one-/two-long exponent margins. Arbitrarily small admissible kappa0 chosen after kappa. Use genuine mixed cube tail, generic complete hb mass, exact-product=N budget, discrepancy tail and selected cutoff payment directly.",
  "threshold_order": "A and fixed orders before targets. m(N)=floor(log N), s(N)=1/(m(N)+1), H(N,A)=L^(A+15+24+paymentExponent(12,0)+3). Same H for original charts, positions, chosen policy, beta,k, all moduli and all frequencies. The frequency auxiliary-SW input bound in log(x) follows from N<=x^(1+kappa) on the same fibre.",
  "physical_endpoint": "Original Q and signed finite-fallback rho with genuine 0.599 support. Norm of full signed modes minus retained actual band <= C*N/L^(A+3). Direct RealB <= X_s D(Q,rho) + Re(retained actual wholeHigh band) + eta H_N, including one instance of the same beta/k and positive mass. No original squarefree global-collision, absolute spectral or retained arithmetic payment asserted.",
